    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925960/extras/a4401593bde24b7d9db0cccd56df66a5.avif?t=1735652584\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Weatherman</strong> is a fast-thinking puzzle simulation game where you rapidly assess gadgets to predict the weather. <br><br>Play as the world-renowned Weatherman, forecasting for your loyal peeps as they brave the ever-changing climate. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925960/extras/54a6e2e73d32ed71ea7ab7a69190f741.poster.avif?t=1735652584\" width=512 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925960/extras/54a6e2e73d32ed71ea7ab7a69190f741.webm?t=1735652584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925960/extras/54a6e2e73d32ed71ea7ab7a69190f741.mp4?t=1735652584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ASSESS \u2013 PREDICT \u2013 REPORT</strong>: A super satisfying gameplay loop that has you quickly correlating all the data from your various gadgets to make your best possible forecast<br></li><li>Use a variety of weather instruments to form your prediction including a heatmap, compass, anemometer, hygrometer and more<br></li><li>Report throughout the ages, experiencing the fun fashion aesthetics of the 70s, 80s, 90s and more!<br></li><li>A wide array of wild weathers ranging anywhere from a pleasant breeze to a deadly snowstorm and perhaps something even more destructive<br></li><li>Featuring over 100 levels to push you to your forecasting limits</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THIS IS FINE!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar